stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Continued to circulate 2 BU @ 3500lpm, 65bar, 30rpm, 2-5kNm. Circulated until H2S level is down to 0. Meanwhile performed TBT for cementing operation and pressure tested cement line to 100bar</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-07-03T21:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-07-03T21:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">2337</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- cement plug</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>R/B stand, P/U pumping sub assembly, M/U TDS</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-07-03T21:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-07-03T22:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">2337</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- cement plug</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Installed cementing hose, lined up cementing line. Pressure tested connection between pumping sub and LTV. Observed leak on LTV.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-07-03T22:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-07-03T22:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">2337</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>interruption -- repair</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Changed out LTV, re-tested cementing line up to 100bar. Good test</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-07-03T22:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-07-04T00:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">2337</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- cement plug</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Placed balanced cement plug (2340 m - 2137 m ): Pumped 20 m3 of wash pill spacer, 2500 l/min/ 33 bar. Mixed and pumped 19,3 m3 of 1,9 SG cement slurry, 600-800 l/min. Displaced the cement to the rig floor with 1000 l of drill water. Zeroed volume counters. Displaced the cement with 22 m3 of sea water, 2700 l/min. Broke and L/D pump in sub assembly.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity>
